# TNT that never stops a server (HorizonsX, 2026-11-06/07, commits 174723cea, d5c4be660, 90903801a): Spigot's
# max-tnt-per-tick (100) and max-tnt-ms-per-tick (25 ms) from spigot.yml, read every 5 s; TNT gets what is left of
# a 40 ms tick (tick-target-ms); explosion exposure cached per tick by centre and box (Paper's optimize-explosions);
# a dedicated server simulates no explosion particles or sounds; item lore, glint override and tooltip display reach
# the client. An 8,000 TNT cube: 10.74 -> 20.02 TPS, worst tick 1300 -> 65 ms. Made by diffing the stage with and
# without the commits (a stage with and without them, diffed), and named zz_ so it applies after every other family's rows.
